# eng_ph_F_dur written as what it does rather than as what the machine does to
# arrive at it, to hold a compiled rule against the one IBM compiled. The
# lower form of it is in es_cdur.dr, which this stands in for.

rule eng_ph_F_dur takes 1 from es_cdur.obj
  call ZZfence_null
  set global half 2226 to 20
  set global half 3150 to 5
  match
end
